  "question": {
    "text": "An alternating voltage source <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>260</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>628</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is connected across a pure inductor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mH</mi></math>. Inductive reactance in the circuit is:"
  },
